      "content": "thanks for the tips. i'm worried a standard HEPA filter might not be enough though, since this smell is so thick and it's making me feel physically unwell. it feels a bit weird how targeted it is, like the misting happens right when i'm trying to sleep. are there any specific types of charcoal filters or maybe even chemical spray solutions that can block these specific kinds of organic compounds? i want to make sure i'm completely sealed off from whatever they're pumping out.",
